<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Eat Club</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to Eat Club</h1>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/menu/">Menu</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about/">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="home">
            <h2>Delicious Food for Everyone</h2>
            <p>Join our Eat Club for the best culinary experience!</p>
        </section>

        <section id="menu-preview" style="text-align: center; padding: 4rem 2rem; background: var(--white); border-radius: var(--border-radius); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px var(--shadow);">
            <h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--dark-color);">Chef's Featured Specialties</h2>
            <p style="color: #666; font-size: 1.15rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;">A sneak peek at some of our hand-crafted, award-winning signature creations.</p>
            
            <div class="menu-container" style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
                <!-- 3 Specialties -->
                <div class="menu-item">
                    <img src="/assets/image/Mozzarella Sticks.jpg" alt="Mozzarella Sticks">
                    <div class="menu-item-content">
                        <h3>Mozzarella Sticks</h3>
                        <p>Crispy breaded mozzarella cheese served with marinara sauce.</p>
                        <span class="price">₹699</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="menu-item">
                    <img src="/assets/image/Margherita Pizza.jpg" alt="Margherita Pizza">
                    <div class="menu-item-content">
                        <h3>Margherita Pizza</h3>
                        <p>Fresh mozzarella, tomato sauce, basil, and olive oil on thin crust.</p>
                        <span class="price">₹1099</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="menu-item">
                    <img src="/assets/image/Classic Tiramisu.jpg" alt="Classic Tiramisu">
                    <div class="menu-item-content">
                        <h3>Classic Tiramisu</h3>
                        <p>Coffee-soaked ladyfingers layered with mascarpone cream.</p>
                        <span class="price">₹649</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <a href="/menu/" class="menu-cta">
                Explore Full Menu <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" style="margin-left: 0.5rem;"></i>
            </a>
        </section>

        <section id="about" style="background: var(--white); padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem); margin: 2.5rem 0;">
            <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;">
                <h2 style="text-align: center; color: var(--dark-color); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem); margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">About Eat Club</h2>

                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                    <div class="about-section" style="background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); transition: transform 0.2s ease;">
                        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-utensils" style="font-size: 3em; color: #ff6b6b; margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="color: #333; font-size: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">Welcome to Eat Club</h3>
                        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Eat Club is your premier online destination for discovering and ordering delicious food from a diverse menu of cuisines. Our website makes it easy to explore mouth-watering dishes, from classic pizzas and burgers to exotic Asian, Mexican, and Indian specialties. We're passionate about bringing culinary adventures right to your fingertips.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-section" style="background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); transition: transform 0.2s ease;">
                        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-list-alt" style="font-size: 3em; color: #4ecdc4; margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="color: #333; font-size: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">Our Online Menu</h3>
                        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Browse through our extensive menu featuring appetizers, main courses, desserts, and beverages. Each item is described in detail with high-quality images and competitive pricing. We offer everything from healthy salads and fresh juices to indulgent cakes and gourmet coffees, ensuring there's something for every taste and dietary preference.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-section" style="background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); transition: transform 0.2s ease;">
                        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-shopping-cart" style="font-size: 3em; color: #45b7d1; margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="color: #333; font-size: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">How to Order</h3>
                        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Ordering is simple and convenient! Just click the "Add to Cart" button on any menu item you love. Our website features smooth navigation, responsive design, and interactive elements. Use the navigation menu to jump between Home, Menu, About, and Contact sections. Your satisfaction is our priority, and we're here to make your dining experience exceptional.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                    <div class="about-section" style="background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); transition: transform 0.2s ease;">
                        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-code" style="font-size: 3em; color: #f39c12; margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="color: #333; font-size: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">Website Features</h3>
                        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Our site boasts modern design with smooth scrolling, delightful animations, and user-friendly interfaces. The menu is thoughtfully organized by categories for easy browsing. We combine real images for authentic items with placeholder images for new additions, ensuring a visually appealing experience. Built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for optimal performance.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-section" style="background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); transition: transform 0.2s ease;">
                        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-heart" style="font-size: 3em; color: #e74c3c; margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="color: #333; font-size: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">Our Passion</h3>
                        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">At Eat Club, we're passionate about food, technology, and creating memorable experiences. We believe great food should be accessible to everyone, and our platform bridges the gap between culinary delights and modern convenience. Join us in celebrating the joy of diverse cuisines and innovative web design that makes ordering a pleasure.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-section" style="background: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); transition: transform 0.2s ease;">
                        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <i class="fas fa-users" style="font-size: 3em; color: #9b59b6; margin-bottom: 15px;"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 style="color: #333; font-size: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;">Community</h3>
                        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">We're more than just a website – we're a community of food lovers. Whether you're a pizza enthusiast, a curry connoisseur, or someone exploring new flavors, Eat Club welcomes you. Our diverse menu reflects our commitment to inclusivity and culinary exploration. Thank you for being part of our food-loving community!</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>Get in touch with us for reservations, catering, or any questions about our menu.</p>
            <div class="contact-info">
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
                    <h4>Email</h4>
                    <p>info@eatclub.com</p>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="fas fa-phone"></i>
                    <h4>Phone</h4>
                    <p>(555) 123-4567</p>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
                    <h4>Address</h4>
                    <p>123 Food Street<br>Flavor Town, FT 12345</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Eat Club. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

    <script is:inline src="/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
